send: You're all set — your account is ready. Try /mood or /help.
> /menu
What would you like to do?
> tap "Medications"
send: Medications

No medications yet. | [Today's doses] [Add medication] [Log dose] [Settings] | [History] [Back]
> tap "Add medication"
send: Let's add a medication.

Reply Back to go back or Cancel to stop.

Add medication — question 1 of 4:

Name (e.g. Vitamin D)
> Vitamin D
Add medication — question 2 of 4:

Dose (e.g. 1000 IU)
> 1000 IU
Add medication — question 3 of 4:

Times (HH:MM, comma-separated) (e.g. 09:00 or 09:00, 21:00 — empty for as-needed)
> 09:00
Add medication — question 4 of 4:

Instructions (e.g. with breakfast)
> with breakfast
Which days?
> tap "Every day"
send: Vitamin D 1000 IU, every day 09:00 Europe/Kyiv | [Create] [Change days] [Change timezone] [Cancel] [Back] [Cancel]
> tap "Create"
send: Vitamin D is set.
